  "summary_en": "ISO catalogue page for the committee draft ISO/CD 26159-1 from ISO/TC 299. It sets out a framework for integrating robots with building infrastructure such as lifts, automatic doors, security and alarm systems. The aim is compatible, safe, secure and reliable operation of multiple robots alongside facilities. CD consultation began in October 2026.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Framework (Part 1) for Infrastructure for Robot Applications (INFRA) aimed at system integrators and facility owners",
